1
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:22,800
A quest to save her world.

2
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:39,600
Raya and the Last Dragon is a animation, family,
fantasy film directed by Don Hall.

3
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:56,400
Long ago, in the fantasy world of Kumandra, humans
and dragons lived together in harmony.

4
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:13,200
But when an evil force threatened the land, the dragons
sacrificed themselves to save humanity.

5
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:30,000
Now, 500 years later, that same evil has returned and it’s up to a lone warrior, Raya, to track
down the legendary last dragon to restore the fractured land and its divided people.

6
00:25:40,800 --> 00:25:46,800
Raya (voice), played by Kelly Marie Tran.

7
00:29:57,600 --> 00:30:03,600
Sisu (voice), played by Awkwafina.

8
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:20,400
Namaari (voice), played by Gemma Chan.

9
00:38:31,200 --> 00:38:37,200
Tuk Tuk (voice), played by Alan Tudyk.

10
00:42:48,000 --> 00:42:54,000
Boun (voice), played by Izaac Wang.

11
00:47:04,800 --> 00:47:10,800
Tong (voice), played by Benedict Wong.

12
00:51:21,600 --> 00:51:27,600
Raya and the Last Dragon ( RYE-ə) is a 2021 American animated fantasy
action film produced by Walt Disney Animation Studios.

13
00:55:38,400 --> 00:55:44,400
It was directed by Don Hall and Carlos López Estrada, and written by Qui Nguyen and Adele Lim, and stars the
voices of Kelly Marie Tran, Awkwafina, Izaac Wang, Gemma Chan, Daniel Dae Kim, and Benedict Wong.

14
00:59:55,200 --> 01:00:01,200
The film's plot follows the warrior princess Raya as she seeks the fabled last dragon to save
her father and the land of Kumandra from evil spirits that are known as Druun.

15
01:04:12,000 --> 01:04:18,000
Development of the project began in October 2018, and it was officially
announced in August 2019, and the title and voice cast were revealed.

16
01:08:28,800 --> 01:08:34,800
During production, Disney replaced several cast and crew members, including the initially announced lead
actor Cassie Steele, who was replaced with Tran to conform with changes in character and plot.

17
01:12:45,600 --> 01:12:51,600
The film is inspired by traditional Southeast Asian cultures.

18
01:17:02,400 --> 01:17:08,400
During design and animation, the filmmakers focused on diverse environments and
characters while maintaining authentic cultural representation.

19
01:21:19,199 --> 01:21:25,199
James Newton Howard composed the film's score.

20
01:25:36,000 --> 01:25:42,000
Raya and the Last Dragon was released in theaters in the United States on March 5, 2021, and
simultaneously on the streaming platform Disney+ for customers with Premier Access.

21
01:29:52,800 --> 01:29:58,800
The film was twice delayed from its November 2020
release date due to the COVID-19 pandemic.

22
01:34:09,600 --> 01:34:15,600
The film became the third-most-streamed film of 2021
and grossed $130.4 million worldwide.

23
01:38:26,400 --> 01:38:32,400
The film received positive reviews from critics and was nominated for several
accolades, including an Academy Award nomination for Best Animated Feature.

24
01:42:43,200 --> 01:42:49,200
The film explores themes of kung fu, sword, warrior
woman, female protagonist, dragon.
